    "bookends": {
      "first": {
        "speaker": 7,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "Hello, mummy!"
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 364,
        "text": "Little girls, this seems to say: Never stop upon your way; Never trust a stranger friend No one knows how it will end. As you're pretty, so be wise Wolves may lurk in every guise Now, as then, ` tis simple truth: Sweetest tongue hides sharpest tooth."
      }
